 that the 275\u219219 event precedes the 19\u21921707 event, (b) that both fall inside [44240, 82639], or (c) that the gap between them is \u2264 600 time units. With single-occurrence edges there is no repeat-event redundancy that could make the ordering probable regardless.\n\nBecause the decisive constraint (time-respecting order with a \u2264600 delay) is exactly the quantity that cannot be measured with the available instrumentation, asserting \"present\" would rest solely on time-ignored connectivity and hub popularity \u2014 the two explanations the task explicitly rules out.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_d7716db7\",\n  \"decision\": \"insufficient\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [275, 19, 1707],\n  \"window\": [44240, 82639],\n  \"confidence\": 0.6,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_08\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ],\n  \"narrative\": \"A single static 2-hop route 275->19->1707 exists, but both legs are one-off events and the intermediary (19) is a top-10 hub with 229 partners and 884 triangles, so time-ignored reachability is largely explained by hub popularity. All available tools aggregate over the full horizon [0,100000] and expose no timestamps or window-restricted queries, so the ordering of the two events, their membership in [44240,82639], and the <=600 inter-event delay cannot be tested. Evidence is insufficient to affirm or deny a genuine time-respecting cascade.\"\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 26265, "total_output_tokens